1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Every morning, Priya makes masala chai.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:08,000
She boils water with crushed ginger and
cardamom, adds tea leaves and milk, then

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,570
strains it into two cups.

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:13,520
Her grandfather says it tastes
just like the chai his mother made.
